## Layout

The committed symlinks sit in one folder per area or project, named `<code>.<Name>` after its node; sub-folders follow the hub chain, plus the Fin split Corporate / Capital-Markets. Each link is `<farm>/<name>` -> `../` per level + name, pointing out to the one clone in `$CLOUD_GIT_BASE` (default `{{base_dir}}`). A link that dangles is a repo you have not cloned yet: that is the index working. No project code lives here.

